iles. While F3 offers potential pattern value (Seat Wind), discarding one F3 doesn\u2019t break that possibility (you still keep two). But given that F3 could contribute to scoring and T4 has minimal strategic value now, better to discard **T4**. Also, B9 and T1 are terminals \u2014 riskier than middle tiles. So between safety and maintaining scoring potential, **Play T4** is optimal.\n\nAnswer: Play T4"}
